{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-37","kind":"proposition","title":"切割线定理的逆命题","englishTitle":"If a point be taken outside a circle and from the point there fall on the circle two straight lines, if one of them cut the circle, and the other fall on it, and if further the rectangle contained by the whole of the straight line which cuts the circle and the straight line intercepted on it outside between the point and the convex circumference be equal to the square on the straight line which falls on the circle, the straight line which falls on it will touch the circle.","book":3,"number":37,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":37,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","contentId":"euclid-3-37","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a5cce4af6a0ebf2cb7fbfec5327b26472b9c8ec085611db527ed596cd018409f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-37.statement","euclid-3-37.construction.1","euclid-3-37.proof.1","euclid-3-37.construction.2","euclid-3-37.proof.2","euclid-3-37.proof.3","euclid-3-37.proof.4","euclid-3-37.proof.5","euclid-3-37.proof.6","euclid-3-37.proof.7","euclid-3-37.proof.8","euclid-3-37.conclusion","euclid-3-37.historical.1","euclid-3-37.historical.2","euclid-3-37.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-37.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75801f18a6a764aa661d37df8dbb70ac25a4f6fadc517e7d99c1ea0968a84f16","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a point be taken outside a circle and from the point there fall on the circle two straight lines, if one of them cut the circle, and the other fall on it, and if further the rectangle contained by the whole of the straight line which cuts the circle and the straight line intercepted on it outside between the point and the convex circumference be equal to the square on the straight line which falls on the circle, the straight line which falls on it will touch the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在圆外取一个点,从圆的点向圆的两条直线相交,如果其中一条截断圆,而另一条相交,如果再由横断圆的整条直线组成的矩形直线,在圆外和圆角之间截断的直线等于横交圆的正方形直线,则相交的直线将触动圆。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜外任于一点出两直线一至规外一割圜至规内而割圜全线偕割圜之规外线矩内直角形与至规外之线上直角方形等则至规外之线必切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在圆外，让两条直线在一点相交：一条延伸到圆外，一条切入圆内。整个圆的线等于圆外直线的平方、圆内矩形和圆外直线的平方相等；那么圆外的直线必须是圆的切线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"999776942232937b5ebdece38509f91b227bca9e05485350deecc5da954eb6ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a point D be taken outside the circle ABC; from D let the two straight lines DCA, DB fall on the circle ACB; let DCA cut the circle and DB fall on it; and let the rectangle AD, DC be equal to the square on DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D点在ABC圈之外,D点在DCA线之间,DB线在ACB线之间,DCA线在ACB线之间,DCA线在DB线之间,矩形、AD线在DC线之间,等于ABC线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6f1effdf17c98e8e7ae715816525134caea1912916b2a255e891cda7599cac4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that DB touches the circle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说DB触摸了ABC圈"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e38ad09488fa1f045961551221d9ab7309e83e7f2cf6c030c708d929778050e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DE be drawn touching ABC; let the centre of the circle ABC be taken, and let it be F; let FE, FB, FD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"绘制DE幅,触摸ABC;将ABC圆的中心划下来,然后划F;将FE、FB、FD幅连接起来。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a041795482ba862a2bd87b413bb87b9e600643f2821cf27660aa09a0feb55fe0","citations":["euclid-3-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus the angle FED is right. [[III. 18](/principles/euclid-3-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FED的该角是直角。 [[III. 18](/principles/euclid-3-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6939c03b7039daba18f68dd5a5fab63be5dfbda1aa07bbb1d9efe534fd4bc0a","citations":["euclid-3-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since DE touches the circle ABC, and DCA cuts it, the rectangle AD, DC is equal to the square on DE. [[III. 36](/principles/euclid-3-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,DE触摸了ABC圈,DCA切开, 矩形 AD,DC等于DE的正方形。 [[III. 36](/principles/euclid-3-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"112f20050d3ba9a8d59c3b8e5b493e51eac42c1382689cd74bb4009111b5dcf9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AD, DC was also equal to the square on DB; therefore the square on DE is equal to the square on DB; therefore DE is equal to DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 AD,DC等值DB的正方形;因此,DE的正方形等值DB的正方形;因此,DE等值DB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7497a09fa525f43b6a0ad6569171720f0e10a24268a3309d19a151fc68740f2d","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FE is equal to FB; therefore the two sides DE, EF are equal to the two sides DB, BF; and FD is the common base of the triangles; therefore the angle DEF is equal to the angle DBF. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FE等于FB;因此,双方DE,EF等于双方DB,BF;FD是三角形的底边公分;因此,角度DEF等于角度DBF。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d9bb3b1269456f49eb73ac38b8b726f4d03df8bafcdd4d2ba763a80a8040ebf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle DEF is right; therefore the angle DBF is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DEF该角是直角,因此DBF角度也是对的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7f7680396e3ae533963d3bf3af5243b96d9ea2084eb272e66af24638c58cc34","citations":["euclid-3-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FB produced is a diameter; and the straight line drawn at right angles to the diameter of a circle, from its extremity, touches the circle; [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)] therefore DB touches the circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"延伸的FB是直径;直角时的直线从极端划至圆的直径,触摸圆,因此,DB触摸圆。 [[III. 16, Por.](/principles/euclid-3-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7665c5381aae438af58c6b12945a5265b3fccdb2ebb241672875414301347c01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly this can be proved to be the case even if the centre be on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,即使中心设在AC,情况也证明如此。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"331c5dd521cab1d3b104f7ec7211114216e9a3f11830df67cf1ce7ddf2068fc9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"圜外任于一点出两直线一至规外一割圜至规内而割圜全线偕割圜之规外线矩内直角形与至规外之线上直角方形等则至规外之线必切圜解曰甲乙丙圜其心戊从丁点作丁乙至规外之线遇圜界于乙又作丁甲割圜至规内之线而截圜界于丙其丁甲偕丁丙矩内直角形与丁乙上直角方形等题言丁乙为切圜线论曰试从丁作丁己线切圜于己〈本篇十七〉次作戊乙戊己两线相联若丁甲不过戊心者又作丁戊直线其丁己上直角方形与丁甲偕丁丙矩内直角形等〈本篇卅六〉而丁乙上直角方形与丁甲偕丁丙矩内直角形亦等则丁乙丁己上两直角方形自相等而丁乙丁己两线亦等夫丁乙戊角形之丁乙乙戊与丁己戊角形之丁己己戊各两腰等丁戊同底即两角形之三角各等〈一卷八〉而对丁戊底之丁己戊为直角〈本篇十八〉即丁乙戊亦直角故丁乙为切圜线〈本篇十六之系〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在圆外，如果两条直线在一点相交——一条在圆外，一条切入圆内，并且整个圆的线等于圆外的线、圆内矩形和圆外直线的平方相等；那么圆外的直线必须与圆相切。解释如下：甲乙丙 圆以 戊 为中心，从点 丁 绘制 丁乙 到圆外直线相交于 乙，然后绘制 丁甲。将圆切入圆内的线并在 丙 切割圆周，然后 丁甲 和 丁丙，矩形在平方内，平方在 丁乙，相等。命题解释：丁乙 是一个切圆。命题解释：丁乙 是一个切圆。证明如下：尝试从 丁 绘制直线 丁己 到切圆。己〈本篇十七〉，绘制 戊乙戊己 作为连接的两条线。如果 丁甲 仅是 戊 的中心，则绘制一条直线 丁戊。丁己 的平方与 丁甲 和 丁丙 矩形的瞬间相等。〈本篇卅六〉 和 丁乙，以及 丁乙、丁甲 和 丁丙 上的平方也在矩形中相等。然后 丁乙丁己 上的两平方相等，丁乙丁己 中的两条线相等。三角形 丁己戊 的 丁乙乙戊 和 丁己己戊 对边相等，因此 丁戊 具有相同的底边，这意味着两个三角形的三角形相等 〈一卷八〉。对于 丁戊，丁己戊 为直角，所以 丁乙 是切圆 〈本篇十六之系〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d8a2f5a1169dbd0442afe138510deeae6f896590b884e7e0fef284813006cfe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"幾何原本卷三"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"原始几何 第3册"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-37.source","contentId":"euclid-3-37","revisionId":"euclid-3-37@raw-a5cce4af6a0ebf2c","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0bc55dcc046a917d921b5c5cb86487bf70a5a899d1319eff7c7af22038b8276","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-37:euclid-3-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-37","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-37.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37/","sourceLabel":"III. 18"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-37:euclid-3-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-37","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-37.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-36","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.37/","sourceLabel":"III. 36"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-3-37:euclid-1-8:explicit","sourceCon